{"title": "Ki-Rin Hair", "pageid": 13644, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Ki-Rin_Hair", "categories": ["Alchemical ingredients", "Common items"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"> <figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Ki-Rin_Hair_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/65/Ki-Rin_Hair_Icon.png/300px-Ki-Rin_Hair_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/6/65/Ki-Rin_Hair_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Ki-Rin Hair image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/65/Ki-Rin_Hair_Icon.png/300px-Ki-Rin_Hair_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/65/Ki-Rin_Hair_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Ki-Rin Hair</b> is an <a href=\"/wiki/Alchemy\" title=\"Alchemy\">Alchemical Ingredient</a>. Combine 3 of these to create a <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sublimate_of_Ki-Rin_Hair\" title=\"Sublimate of Ki-Rin Hair\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/dd/Sublimate_of_Ki-Rin_Hair_Item_Icon.png/20px-Sublimate_of_Ki-Rin_Hair_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/dd/Sublimate_of_Ki-Rin_Hair_Item_Icon.png/30px-Sublimate_of_Ki-Rin_Hair_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/dd/Sublimate_of_Ki-Rin_Hair_Item_Icon.png/40px-Sublimate_of_Ki-Rin_Hair_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/dd/Sublimate_of_Ki-Rin_Hair_Item_Icon.png/20px-Sublimate_of_Ki-Rin_Hair_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/dd/Sublimate_of_Ki-Rin_Hair_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Sublimate_of_Ki-Rin_Hair\" title=\"Sublimate of Ki-Rin Hair\">Sublimate of Ki-Rin Hair</a>, which can be used to make a <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Potion_of_Supreme_Healing\" title=\"Potion of Supreme Healing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a6/POT_Potion_of_Supreme_Healing_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-POT_Potion_of_Supreme_Healing_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a6/POT_Potion_of_Supreme_Healing_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-POT_Potion_of_Supreme_Healing_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a6/POT_Potion_of_Supreme_Healing_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-POT_Potion_of_Supreme_Healing_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a6/POT_Potion_of_Supreme_Healing_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-POT_Potion_of_Supreme_Healing_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a6/POT_Potion_of_Supreme_Healing_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Potion_of_Supreme_Healing\" title=\"Potion of Supreme Healing\">Potion of Supreme Healing</a>.\n\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>Many view <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Ki-rin\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"ki-rin\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Ki-rin\">ki-rin</a></span> as heralds of good fortune, and for good reason - even the tiniest strand of their hair holds a wealth of benevolent magic.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Alchemical_Ingredients\" title=\"Alchemical Ingredients\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7c/Alchemy_Icon.png/25px-Alchemy_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7c/Alchemy_Icon.png/38px-Alchemy_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7c/Alchemy_Icon.png/50px-Alchemy_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Alchemical Ingredients\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7c/Alchemy_Icon.png/25px-Alchemy_Icon.png.webp\" decodi